ge?\"},{\"is_multi_select\":false,\"options\":[\"(Recommended) Save Ubuntu runs to separate files (thesis_ubuntu_results.csv, thesis_ubuntu_raw_samples.csv, thesis_ubuntu_report.md) AND also include an image_alias column so Alpine files remain untouched\",\"Append Ubuntu runs directly into the existing thesis_stress_test_results.csv and thesis_raw_team_samples.csv with an image_alias column\"],\"question\":\"How should the Ubuntu CSV and Markdown outputs be stored?\"},{\"is_multi_select\":false,\"options\":[\"(Recommended) /home/debian/bluectfd/thesis_notes.md on the remote server (plus a synced copy in the local workspace)\",\"/home/debian/bluectfd/blueagent/thesis_notes.md inside the blueagent subfolder\"],\"question\":\"Where should we create the dedicated context file containing only your thesis notes and findings (like the CoW speedup factor)?\"}]","toolAction":"\"Asking clarifying questions for Ubuntu benchmark and thesis notes\"","toolSummary":"\"Clarify Ubuntu image, tiers, CSV storage, and notes path\""}}]}
